# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   G. Laskaris et al. (2026). Multi-objective optimization and quantum hybridization of equivariant deep learning interatomic potentials.
#   Jyväskylä University Digital Archive (University of Jyväskylä). doi:10.1016/j.commatsci.2026.114742  arXiv:2602.16908v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2602.16908v2 (sha256 4e3490eaf57eed64...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 118 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: Allegro and two modified variants (an added MLP, and a
# quantum-classical hybrid with a QDI layer), each tuned by
# multi-objective hyperparameter optimisation on rMD17 aspirin, rMD17
# benzene, QM9 and an in-house Cu-Li interface data set, with the best
# validation MAEs (Tables IV and V) and the tuned hyperparameters of
# Tables I and II.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-laskaris2026 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Laskaris et al. (2026): multi-objective optimization and quantum hybridization of equivariant deep learning interatomic potentials (Allegro variants)" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-laskaris2026 .

